# Outbound mail through Amazon SES (mail.tf) on staging, planned against mock
# providers: offline, no credentials. Staging's account holds identities of
# its own: staging.<domain> (its DKIM and MAIL FROM records under `staging` in
# the zone) and the forward_to address (its SES sandbox's recipient); its
# worker sends as support@staging.<domain> through them alone, never as prod's
# sender nor through prod's identities.

